<title>SOUTH AFRICA: TABLE - Consol year earnings slip.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Consol year earnings slip.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Shr, (cts)</p>
<p>    - headline		251.4	 vs   343.8</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 102.0	 vs   same</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   383.55	vs   229.67</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   410.76	vs   323.02</p>
<p>    Income after tax	383.89	vs   230.55</p>
<p>    Turnover		2,509.60	vs 3,320.00</p>
<p>Full name: Consol Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said it expected an increase in earnings in the year ahead despite a projected higher tax rate and adverse economic conditions.</p>
